rk (organizing clothes) — **Partially correct.**\n\nTherefore, **answer ‘3’ is not fully accurate** for the activities shown in these 30 frames. The video segment does not include breakfast preparation, which is a key component of the answer.\n\n> ✅ **Final Verdict: Answer ‘3’ is incorrect for this time segment.**  \n> The woman is awake and does light organizing, but she does not cook breakfast.'}, {'batch_start': 90, 'batch_end': 120, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0173.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0174.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0175.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0176.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0177.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0178.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0179.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0180.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0181.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0182.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0183.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0184.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0185.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0195.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0196.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0197.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0198.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0199.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0200.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0201.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/