\n**1) Is the woman awake and out of bed?**  \n✅ **Yes.**  \n- Frames 7–11 show the woman, wearing a cozy sweater, interacting with a bedside lamp — turning it on or adjusting it. This strongly implies she has just woken up and is beginning her morning routine.  \n- She is clearly out of bed and active in her room.\n\n---\n\n**2) Does she cook/prepare breakfast?**  \n✅ **Partially — she prepares a hot beverage, likely as part of breakfast.**  \n- Frames 16–30 show her placing a pink coaster, then a glass mug with a lemon slice, and pouring hot water into it — clearly preparing lemon water or tea.  \n- While this is not “cooking” in the traditional sense (no frying, baking, etc.), it is a common breakfast ritual and falls under “preparing breakfast” in a broad, lifestyle-video context.  \n- *Note:* The global summary mentions “preparing and drinking tea or coffee” as part of her routine — this aligns.\n\n---\n\n**3) Does she do housework (cleaning, organizing, etc.)?**  \n✅ **Yes — at least one housework-related activity is visible.**  \n- Frames 1–5 show her pouring water into a humidifier — this is a form of home maintenance or self-care that contributes to a clean, comfortable environment.  \n- The global summary includes “using a humidifier” under “practicing self-care,” which overlaps with light housework or home upkeep.  \n- No sweeping, mopping, or deep cleaning is visible in these frames, but adding water to a humidifier qualifies as a minor housework task.\n\n---\n\n**4) Does she go to the gym?**  \n❌ **No.**  \n- There is no evidence of gym activity, workout gear, or exercise equipment in these frames.\n\n---\n\n**5) Does she go back to sleep?**  \n❌ **No.**  \n- She is actively engaging in morning routines — turning on lights, preparing drinks, interacting with objects — all indicating she is awake and starting her day.\n\n---\n\n**Temporal Sequence of Activities (00:00–00:30):**  \n1. **Frames 1–5:** Filling a humidifier with water → home maintenance / self-care.  \n2. **Frames 7–11:** Turning on a bedside lamp → waking up / starting the day.  \n3. **Frames 16–30:** Preparing lemon water/tea → breakfast ritual.  \n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:**  \n✅ The answer **“3: She gets up, cooks her breakfast and does some housework”** is **correct for this segment**, with minor caveats:  \n- “Cooks breakfast” is interpreted loosely as preparing a hot beverage (common in lifestyle videos).  \n- “Housework” includes maintaining home appliances like a humidifier.  \n- All key elements (awake, breakfast prep, light housework) are present in the correct temporal order.\n\n**Final Verdict: ✅ Correct.**'}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 90, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0065.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0075.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0076.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0077.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0078.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0079.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0080.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0081.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0082.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0083.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0084.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0085.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0086.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0087.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0088.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0089.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0090.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/dat