usework**:  \n- Frames 14–20: She uses a **lint roller** on a black garment.  \n- Frames 21–24: She continues using the lint roller while seated.  \n- Frames 25–29: She empties lint from the roller into a pile on the table — a clear housekeeping action.  \n- Frame 30: She uses an **iron** on a garment.  \n\nThese actions fall under “housework” as they involve clothing maintenance and organization. While not general cleaning (like sweeping or wiping surfaces), they are domestic chores.\n\n---\n\n**4) Does she go to the gym?**\n\n❌ **No.**  \nThere is no evidence of gym activity, workout clothes, exercise equipment, or physical training in any of the frames. The setting remains indoors, focused on clothing care.\n\n---\n\n**5) Does she go back to sleep?**\n\n❌ **No.**  \nShe remains active throughout all 30 frames — selecting clothes, lint-rolling, ironing. No sleeping or resting in bed is shown.\n\n---\n\n**Temporal Sequence of Activities (00:00–14:00):**\n\n1. **Frames 1–13:** Woman selects a black garment from a closet — indicates she is awake and beginning her day.\n2. **Frames 14–24:** She lays the garment on a surface and uses a lint roller to clean it — housework.\n3. **Frames 25–29:** She empties lint from the roller — continuation of housework.\n4. **Frame 30:** She begins ironing the garment — further housework/clothing care.\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:**\n\nThe answer **“3: She gets up, cooks her breakfast and does some housework” is NOT fully correct** for this segment.\n\n- ✅ She is awake and out of bed — **CORRECT**.\n- ❌ She does **not** cook or prepare breakfast — **INCORRECT** for this segment.\n- ✅ She does housework (clothing care) — **CORRECT**.\n\nTherefore, **the answer is partially correct but misleading** because it falsely implies breakfast preparation occurred in this time frame. The video segment shows **only clothing-related housework**, not cooking.\n\n---\n\n**Final Verdict: Answer ‘3’ is incorrect for this 30-frame segment.**  \nThe accurate description would be:  \n> *She gets up, selects clothes, and does laundry-related housework (lint rolling and ironing).*'}, {'batch_start': 120, 'batch_end': 150, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0251.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0252.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0253.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0254.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0255.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0275.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0276.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0277.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0278.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0279.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0280.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0281.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0282.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0283.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0284.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0285.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0286.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0287.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0288.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0289.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0290.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0291.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0292.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/jp2M1hIEtsk/frames/frame_0293.j